From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Martins <eduardo@martins.ws>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:16:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: regulator: apple,pmic-touch-regulator: Add Acorn

The iPhone X touchscreen's analog supply is switched in the Acorn display
PMU.

Assisted-by: LLM
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml         | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
index ad2902308..45521f912 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ maintainers:
 
 description:
   Fixed touchscreen supply switches provided by the D2186, D2207, Adelyn,
-  Angel and Chestnut PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
+  Angel, Chestnut and Acorn PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
   register layout is an implementation detail of the regulator driver.
 
 allOf:
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ allOf:
 properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
+      - apple,acorn-touch-analog-regulator
       - apple,adelyn-touch-core-regulator
       - apple,angel-touch-analog-regulator
       - apple,chestnut-touch-hv-regulator
